mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>This course applies relevant medical professional knowledge to learn about the signs of corpses in violent and non-violent death cases, and master theoretical and practical skills such as the causes of death, manner of death, inference of injuring objects, and estimation of time of death in major death cases. After learning the theories and techniques, this course mandates students to conduct on-site investigations and corpse examinations of forensic cases, in order to comprehensively analyze the findings and draw scientific conclusions, in aim of providing medical evidence for judicial fairness.&nbsp;</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:19.9000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
